V-GUARD INDUSTRIES: 

CO SAYS FY27 EBITDA MARGIN GUIDANCE MAINTAINED AT 9.5-10%; FY27 CAPEX GUIDANCE NARROWED TO ₹150 CR; 

WIRES GROWTH ENTIRELY PRICE-LED AS VOLUMES REMAIN FLAT

EQUITAS SMALL FINANCE BANK: 

P. N. VASUDEVAN SAYS HIS DECISION TO STEP DOWN AS MD & CEO FOLLOWS AN ISSUE THAT HAS PERSISTED FOR 2–3 YEARS, NOT AN OVERNIGHT DECISION; 

SAYS THERE IS NO CONFLICT OF INTEREST, CALLING IT MERELY A PERCEPTION

ESCORTS KUBOTA LIMITED: 

CO. ANNOUNCES PRICE INCREASE ON TRACTORS ACROSS ALL BRANDS EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 2026; 

RISE DUE TO INFLATIONARY PRESSURES AND GEOPOLITICAL UNCERTAINTIES; PRICE VARIATION ACROSS MODELS AND GEOGRAPHIES.
